<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Petronas</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1974">1974</a>–</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as Petroliam Nasional Berhad</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Petronas (Petroliam Nasional Berhad) is Malaysia's state-owned oil and gas company, founded in 1974 and vested with ownership of the country's petroleum resources. Its revenues have been a major source of government income, and it operates internationally in exploration, production and liquefied natural gas. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/petronas-twin-towers">Petronas Twin Towers</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kuala-lumpur">Kuala Lumpur</a> house its headquarters.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/petronas.jpg" alt="Petronas" width="320" height="320" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Petronas · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PETRONAS_Logo_(2013).png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
